## Angular workspace

- Install the Bun workspace: `bun install`.
- Serve the default application: `bun run --cwd {frontend.root} dev`.
- Build the default application: `bun run --cwd {frontend.root} build`.
{{#each angular.applicationNames as this}}- Serve `{{this}}`: `bun run --cwd {frontend.root} dev:{{this}}`.
- Build `{{this}}`: `bun run --cwd {frontend.root} build:{{this}}`.
{{/each}}

Use the application-specific scripts in multi-application workspaces. These
commands stay Angular-only; Apollo, Tauri, testing, release, and delivery
commands come from their own selected pieces.
